OL,3,GNEWSA'I dreaded being asked if I had
OL,4,Achildren'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Do you have children?"
OL,8,FFor years, that was the question Connie
OL,9,FKerr dreaded.
OL,11,FConnie, from Manchester, said she had
OL,12,Fdone "all the right things". She had a
OL,13,Fsuccessful career, a husband and
OL,14,Fassumed children would follow.
OL,16,FBut after four miscarriages in the
OL,17,Fspace of two years, the future she
OL,18,Fimagined for herself was taken away.
